timeline
    title Cybersecurity Career Progression
    section Entry Level (0-2 years)
        SOC Analyst : $55-75K : Monitor security events, investigate alerts
        Security Analyst : $60-80K : Risk assessment, compliance support
        IT Security Specialist : $50-70K : Network security, access control
    section Mid-Level (2-5 years)
        Security Engineer : $90-130K : Design security systems, automation
        Penetration Tester : $100-140K : Ethical hacking, vulnerability assessment
        Incident Responder : $85-120K : DFIR, threat hunting
        Cloud Security Engineer : $110-145K : AWS, Azure, GCP security
    section Senior (5-10 years)
        Security Architect : $140-190K : Enterprise security design
        Principal Security Engineer : $150-200K : Technical leadership
        Red Team Lead : $140-180K : Advanced adversary simulation
        Security Manager : $130-170K : Team leadership, strategy
    section Leadership (10+ years)
        Director of Security : $180-250K : Department leadership
        VP of Security : $200-300K : Executive security strategy
        CISO : $250-450K+ : C-suite, board-level security
